      "updated": 1795226724748,
      "created": 1794834485014,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Belts: maximum of three belts. first one is free, 2nd and 3rd are meta\nprogression upgrades.\nBalls: Use the stable front face (top Row) of\nassets\\icons\\pokeballs\\in-run-pokeballs.png\n \nOn Throw: The ball pops up and out of the box and is thrown to the\nPortrait. uses the spinning animation, then the side to side animation\nfor the classic three flashes from the mainline games. ",
      "fontSize": 10.714285714285714,
      "baseFontSize": 10.714285714285714,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Cr3DGKY5aDB4MBFKcrVCo",
      "originalText": "Belts: maximum of three belts. first one is free, 2nd and 3rd are meta progression upgrades.\nBalls: Use the stable front face (top Row) of assets\\icons\\pokeballs\\in-run-pokeballs.png\n \nOn Throw: The ball pops up and out of the box and is thrown to the Portrait. uses the spinning animation, then the side to side animation for the classic three flashes from the mainline games. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
