      "text": "Inventory Panel\n#29ceff thin rim, #303030 panel body\n\nSearch bar by name\n\nInventory squares uses the same shape as the Move\nSlot/Cards Taken/Run Stats panel from the Pokemon\nDetail Panel in the Pause Menu but sized up to fit 4 to\na row. Scrollable container. Non-Filled slots are dimmed. \n\nHover tooltip on inventory slot with Name \\n\nDescription of item.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "o5RjLDiXPqVV9x53P9Iyh",
      "originalText": "Inventory Panel\n#29ceff thin rim, #303030 panel body\n\nSearch bar by name\n\nInventory squares uses the same shape as the Move Slot/Cards Taken/Run Stats panel from the Pokemon Detail Panel in the Pause Menu but sized up to fit 4 to a row. Scrollable container. Non-Filled slots are dimmed. \n\nHover tooltip on inventory slot with Name \\n Description of item.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
