      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794880785165,
      "created": 1794879881690,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hover Tooltip\nAlways Top Most Layer\n#f3b200 rim, #181818 panel body\nName {if applicable} #ffd23f\nText: White\nPin Icon in top right corner #adadad pins the\nspecific unique hover tooltip from disappearing.\nOnce pinned, the top right icon is an \"X\"\n#adadad that unpins it. \n\n/Future Feature\nSome key words can be hovered to get an\nadditional tooltip on top. Allowing for futher\ninformation as in Path of Exile 1&2.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "kdpRSo9RhQytD3a7ihEZ2",
      "originalText": "Hover Tooltip\nAlways Top Most Layer\n#f3b200 rim, #181818 panel body\nName {if applicable} #ffd23f\nText: White\nPin Icon in top right corner #adadad pins the specific unique hover tooltip from disappearing.\nOnce pinned, the top right icon is an \"X\" #adadad that unpins it. \n\n/Future Feature\nSome key words can be hovered to get an additional tooltip on top. Allowing for futher information as in Path of Exile 1&2.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
