      "text": "panel.clean.rest holds portraits of pokemon. Portrait\nsized undetermined, but starting value of 88px like the\nrun.hud.playerActive.area.\nHas scrollbar. no primitive made yet in UI library but we\ndo have a scrollbar to copy from in the shop UI\ncurrently.  ",
