      "text": "Both buttons return to main menu. \nCommit uses positive intent button.\nDiscard uses negative intent button.\nESC defaults to Discard, with a toast if\nchanges were made \"Changes discarded.\"",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "2mPTydI-fM5HZyOx-NiIx",
      "originalText": "Both buttons return to main menu. \nCommit uses positive intent button.\nDiscard uses negative intent button.\nESC defaults to Discard, with a toast if changes were made \"Changes discarded.\"",
