      "updated": 1795461176886,
      "created": 1795460901254,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sell Pokemon button uses negative button. \nSells the next clicked pokemon using mouse or next selected pokemon with ENTER or\nSPACE on keyboard, notifies with toast that remains until a pokemon is selected. \nConfirmation dialog modal: \"Sell {name} for NN?\" \"Sell\"|\"Cancel\" default to cancel, Sell uses\nnegative button, cancel uses neutral.\nShift-Click converts to bulk sell:\nAllows highlighting of multiple pokemon. Then clicking Sell Pokemon again throws\nConfirmation Dialog: \"Sell selected pokemon for NN?\" \"Sell\"|\"Cancel\". \nClicking Sell brings a second dialog: \"Confirm\"|\"Cancel\" with no prompt. Shift click on initial\nbulk sell dialog skips second confirmation.",
      "fontSize": 17.151515151515113,
      "baseFontSize": 19.151515151515113,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "mKo9l_RmqeOW7MLMcRllq",
      "originalText": "Sell Pokemon button uses negative button. \nSells the next clicked pokemon using mouse or next selected pokemon with ENTER or SPACE on keyboard, notifies with toast that remains until a pokemon is selected. \nConfirmation dialog modal: \"Sell {name} for NN?\" \"Sell\"|\"Cancel\" default to cancel, Sell uses negative button, cancel uses neutral.\nShift-Click converts to bulk sell:\nAllows highlighting of multiple pokemon. Then clicking Sell Pokemon again throws Confirmation Dialog: \"Sell selected pokemon for NN?\" \"Sell\"|\"Cancel\". \nClicking Sell brings a second dialog: \"Confirm\"|\"Cancel\" with no prompt. Shift click on initial bulk sell dialog skips second confirmation.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
